    <h4>About me</h4>
    <p>
      I'm an director of engineering. I did software development for 20+ years,
      primarily focused on crafting smooth user interfaces, accessiblity, and
      client-side performance.
    </p>
    <p>
      I love building communities. I cofounded Women Who Code NYC and
      co-organized BoulderJS until 2021.
    </p>
    <p>
      I was born and raised in the city of Chicago, but now reside in
      <del>San Francisco</del> <del>NYC</del> Boulder, Colorado.
    </p>
